<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Extension Connected Successfully</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #333;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 5px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #0c4a6e;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #007bff;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #888;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <div class="header">
      ✅ Extension Connected Successfully
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Great news! Your EngageGPT Chrome Extension has been successfully connected.</p>
      <p>You can now:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>📊 Sync and view your LinkedIn analytics</li>
        <li>⚡ Access powerful AI tools directly from your LinkedIn feed</li>
        <li>🧠 Unlock features like Post Generator, AI Comments, Connection Notes, Message Replies, and more</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <a class="cta-button" href="https://engagegpt.in/dashboard" target="_blank">Go to Dashboard</a>
      </p>
      <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email or visit our support page.</p>
      <p>Cheers,<br>The EngageGPT Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EngageGPT. All rights reserved.<br>
      <a href="https://engagegpt.in">engagegpt.in</a> | <a href="mailto:engagegpt@gmail.com">Support</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>